From: mrdidit <26687854+mrdidit@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: add opt-in KPFE manual charge-rate diagnostic

Adapt dxu16 charge-rate-stop at cb876c16583e9f57047f61f1df4b2a1ee5d0ebfc.
Expose explicit rate 0/100 requests only with manual_charge_rate=1 on KPFE.
Block native percentage and constant-current controls in diagnostic mode;
end threshold 100 disables native percentage enforcement. No automatic
threshold worker or property-29 policy is included.

Readback is the last acknowledged command, not measured hardware bypass.
Return ENODATA before the first successful command and after a service
generation change or failed command. Serialize notification registration
with other requests and reject unrelated response opcodes during the
diagnostic. No charging command is issued at boot or replayed on reconnect.

Source: https://github.com/dxu16/kpfe-charge-limit/blob/cb876c16583e9f57047f61f1df4b2a1ee5d0ebfc/experimental/charge-rate-stop/charge-rate-diagnostic.patch

